   "d": "2022-01-25",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "Currently, the Board expects COVID-19 reported sales could be reduced by around 50% in 2022, versus 2021, which will be partially offset by new non-COVID-19 products which will start to come onstream in Q4 2022.",
   "file": "20220125_NCYT_Strategy-and-Full-Year-2021-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-04-28",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "If this rate of COVID-19 related sales decline continues for the remainder of 2022, the Board expects full year revenues of circa £35m-£45m.",
   "file": "20220428_NCYT_Full-year-results-and-update-on-growth-strategy.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-07",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "This would deliver an EBITDA loss for 2022 of circa £11.0m, or £4.5m loss for the underlying business when the impact of the additional £6.5m stock provision is excluded.",
   "file": "20220707_NCYT_Trading-update-and-progress-against-strategy.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-29",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "The Company does not expect demand for its COVID-19 products to pick up in Q4 2022 as previously anticipated, therefore, the Board expects Q4 2022 revenue to be similar to Q3 2022 resulting in an anticipated EBITDA loss for the full year of circa £13.5m.",
   "file": "20220929_NCYT_Half-year-2022-results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-01-26",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Reported revenues and EBITDA for the period are both expected to be in line with guidance.",
   "file": "20230126_NCYT_Full-Year-2022-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-04-27",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "This has been a slower than expected start to the year particularly in instrumentation where we are seeing an over-hang of inventories that customers built up during the pandemic.",
   "file": "20230427_NCYT_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-27",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "Instrument sales have increased by over 65% in Q2 2023 compared with Q1 2023, showing signs of market improvement following the saturation that was seen during the COVID-19 pandemic, and non-COVID sales have increased incrementally over the last three quarters.",
   "file": "20230727_NCYT_Half-Year-Trading-Update.md",
   "gnote": "early signal: first step up in tone"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-09-28",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "At this early stage we need to do further work on the combined businesses to determine financial/EBITDA expectations for FY 2023.",
   "file": "20230928_NCYT_2023-Interim-Results.md",
   "gnote": "discounted: Yourgene acquisition"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-01-25",
